# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kyle Cudal — portfolio .gitignore
# Keeps the repo lean: only the files the live site actually needs
# get pushed. Your full-size camera originals stay on your Mac.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Original camera files (NOT used by the site — the site loads the
# compressed copies in Media/web/ instead). ~366 MB, keep local only.
Media/Photos/
Media/Video/
Media/Me/

# macOS junk
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Editor / OS / tooling clutter
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/

# Node stuff (not used here, but harmless to ignore)
node_modules/
